# Subject: sentence case, imperative, no trailing period, <= 72 chars.
# Say what the change does, not what you did.
#
# ---- body (optional; delete if the subject is enough) ----------------
#
# Explain the problem this solves and the decision taken. Include a
# consequence a future reader needs: behaviour that changes, a
# constraint accepted, a trade-off made. Wrap at 72 columns.
#
# Do not narrate the work: no dead ends, no chronology, no assessment
# of how it went. That belongs in the pull request conversation, not in
# permanent history.
#
# No model co-author trailers or tool footers. AI authorship is
# disclosed once in the README. See AGENTS.md.
